  "title": "Tronox Announces Dates for First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release & Webcast Conference Call",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn., April 9, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Tronox Holdings plc (NYSE: TROX) announced today the following schedule for its first quarter 2026 earnings release and webcast conference call: Earnings Release: Wednesday, May 6, 2026, after market close via PR Newswire and the Tronox Holdings plc website: tronox.com Webcast Conference Call: Thursday, May 7, 2026 at 9:00 … Continue reading \"Tronox Announces Dates for First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release & Webcast Conference Call\"",
